{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-zep-2-1","title":"Zephaniah 2:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 An exhortation to repentance. 4 The judgment of the Philistines, 8 of Moab and Ammon, 12 of Ethiopia, 13 and of Assyria.</p>\n<p>gather together. 2Ch 20:4; Ne 8:1; 9:1; Es 4:16; Joe 1:14; 2:12-18; Mt 18:20 O nation. Isa 1:4-6,10-15; Jer 12:7-9; Zec 11:8 desired. or, desirous. Isa 26:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-2","title":"Zephaniah 2:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the decree. 3:8; 2Ki 22:16,17; 23:26,27; Eze 12:25; Mt 24:35; 2Pe 3:4-10 as. Job 21:18; Ps 1:4; Isa 17:13; 41:15,16; Ho 13:3 before the fierce. 1:18; 2Ch 36:16,17; Ps 2:12; 50:22; Jer 23:20; La 4:11; Na 1:6 Mal 4:1,2; Lu 13:24-28 before the day of. Ps 95:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-3","title":"Zephaniah 2:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Seek ye. Ps 105:4; Isa 55:6,7; Jer 3:13,14; 4:1,2; 29:12,13; Ho 7:10; 10:12 Am 5:4-6,14,15; Mt 7:7,8 all. 2Ch 34:27,28; Ps 22:26; 25:8,9; 76:9; 149:4; Isa 61:1; Jer 22:15,16 Zec 8:19; Mt 5:5; Jas 1:21,22; 1Pe 3:4 seek righteousness. Php 3:13,14; 1Th 4:1,10; 1Pe 1:22; 2Pe 3:18 it may. 2Sa 12:22; Joe 2:13,14; Am 5:15; Jon 3:9 hid. Ge 7:15,16; Ex 12:27; Ps 31:20; 32:6,7; 57:1; 91:1; Pr 18:10 Isa 26:20,21; Jer 39:18; 45:5; Col 3:2-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-4","title":"Zephaniah 2:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Gaza. Jer 25:20; 47:1-7; Eze 25:15-17; Am 1:6-8; Zec 9:5-7 at. Ps 91:6; Jer 6:4; 15:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-5","title":"Zephaniah 2:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Cherethites. Jer 47:7; Eze 25:16 Cherethims. the word. Am 3:1; 5:1; Zec 1:6; Mr 12:12 O Canaan. Jos 13:3; Jud 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-6","title":"Zephaniah 2:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the sea. 14,15; Isa 17:2; Eze 25:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-7","title":"Zephaniah 2:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>the coast. Isa 14:29-32; Ob 1:19; Zec 9:6,7; Ac 8:26,40 the remnant. 9; Isa 11:11; Jer 31:7; Mic 2:12; 4:7; 5:3-8; Hag 1:12; 2:2; Ro 11:5 for. or, when, etc. shall visit. Ge 50:24; Ex 4:31; Lu 1:68; 7:16 turn. 3:20; Ps 85:1; 126:1-4; Isa 14:1; Jer 3:18; 23:3; 29:14; 30:3,18,19 Jer 33:7; Eze 39:25; Am 9:14,15; Mic 4:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-8","title":"Zephaniah 2:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>heard. Jer 48:27-29; Eze 25:8-11 the revilings. Ps 83:4-7; Jer 49:1; Eze 25:3-7; 36:2; Am 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-9","title":"Zephaniah 2:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>as I. Nu 14:21; Isa 49:18; Jer 46:18; Ro 14:11 Surely. Isa 11:14; 15:1-16:14; 25:10; Jer 48:1-49:7; Eze 25:1-26:21 Am 1:13-15; 2:1-3 as Gomorrah. 14; Ge 19:24,25; De 29:23; Isa 13:19,20; 34:9-13; Jer 49:18; 50:40 the residue. 7; 3:13; Joe 3:19,20; Mic 5:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-10","title":"Zephaniah 2:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>for. 8; Isa 16:6; Jer 48:29; Da 4:37; 5:20-23; Ob 1:3; 1Pe 5:5 and magnified. Ex 9:17; 10:3; Isa 10:12-15; 37:22-29; Eze 38:14-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-11","title":"Zephaniah 2:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>for. De 32:38; Ho 2:17; Zec 13:2 famish. Heb. make lean. and men. Ps 2:8-12; 22:27-30; 72:8-11,17; 86:9; 97:6-8; 117:1,2; 138:4 Isa 2:2-4; 11:9,10; Mic 4:1-3; Zec 2:11; 8:20,23; 14:9-21; Mal 1:11 Joh 4:21-23; 1Ti 2:8; Re 11:15 the isles. Ge 10:5; Isa 24:14-16; 42:4,10; 49:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-12","title":"Zephaniah 2:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>Ethiopians. Isa 18:1-7; 20:4,5; 43:3; Jer 46:9,10; Eze 30:4-9 my. Ps 17:13; Isa 10:5; 13:5; Jer 47:6,7; 51:20-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-13","title":"Zephaniah 2:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>he will. Ps 83:8,9; Isa 10:12,16; 11:11; Eze 31:3-18 will make. Na 1:1; 2:10,11; 3:7,15,18,19; Zec 10:10,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-14","title":"Zephaniah 2:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>flocks. 6; Isa 13:19-22; 34:11-17; Re 18:2 commorant. or, pelican. upper lintels. or, knops, orchapiters. Am 9:1 for he shall uncover. or, when he hath uncovered. the cedar. Jer 22:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zep-2-15","title":"Zephaniah 2:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEP","chapterStart":2,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":2,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>the rejoicing. Isa 10:12-14; 22:2; 47:7; Re 18:7-10 I am. Isa 47:8; Eze 28:2,9; 29:3 how is. Isa 14:4,5; La 1:1; 2:1; Re 18:10-19 every. 1Ki 9:7,8; Job 27:23; Ps 52:6,7; La 2:15; Eze 27:36; Na 3:19 Mt 27:39</p>"}]}